TI  - A systematic review supporting the Society for Vascular Surgery, the American Venous Forum, and the American Vein and Lymphatic Society guidelines on the management of varicose veins
AU  - Magdoleen H. Farah
AU  - Tarek Nayfeh
AU  - Meritxell Urtecho
AU  - Bashar Hasan
AU  - Mustapha Amin
AU  - Indrani Sen
AU  - Zhen Wang
AU  - Larry J. Prokop
