TI  - Endovenous chemical ablation and trendelenburg’s (eCAT) operation for treating great saphenous vein varicosities: a single-arm open-label interventional study
AU  - Walied Khereba
AU  - Al Metwaly Ragab
AU  - Ayman Amen MohyElden
AU  - Khaled Attia
AU  - Osama Moeen
