TI  - Ultrasound-guided perisaphenous tumescence infiltration improves the outcomes of long catheter foam sclerotherapy combined with phlebectomy of the varicose tributaries
AU  - Attilio Cavezzi
AU  - Giovanni Mosti
AU  - Sonia Di Paolo
AU  - L Tessari
AU  - Fausto Campana
AU  - S Urso
JO  - Veins and Lymphatics
PY  - 2015
VL  - 4
IS  - 1
