TI  - Endovenous cyanoacrylate glue to treat varicose veins and chronic venous insufficiency—Experience gained from our first 100+ truncal venous ablations in a multi-ethnic Asian population using the Medtronic VenaSeal™ Closure System
AU  - Tjun Yip Tang
AU  - Harsha Pitumpe Rathnaweera
AU  - Jia Wen Kam
AU  - Tze Tec Chong
AU  - E.C. Choke
AU  - Yih Kai Tan
