TI  - Evolution of surgical treatment methods for patients with varicose veins
AU  - Sergei N. Derkachev
AU  - Igor G. Kobzar
AU  - Shamshi V. Selimov
AU  - Maria A. Figurkina
AU  - Igor SUCHKOV
JO  - I P Pavlov Russian Medical Biological Herald
