AB  - In this article, the authors indicate the main methods of surgical treatment of patients with varicose veins of the lower extremities. The main issues related to endovenous methods of varicose vein obliteration are analyzed and described. Literary sources were searched for by keywords in the international abstract database PubMed. gov, as well as the Russian RSCI system over the past 20 years. Over 50 scientific publications have been studied. With the use of modern methods of treating patients with varicose veins of the lower extremities, the number of outpatient procedures is increasing, while improving the quality of life.
